{"ordinal":14241,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452534902784","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Ballerina_Ears_DontShoot_00cf100","source":"Ballerina: Ушки. Хе-хе-хе.","target":"Ballerina: Urechiușe. He-he-he.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-362.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14242,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452530708491","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Ballerina_Photo_DontShoot_0696e55","source":"Ballerina: Удобно.","target":"Ballerina: Comod.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-362.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14243,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452530708490","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Ballerina_Photo_DontShoot_01196a3","source":"Ballerina: Мне кажется, ты сидишь дурачком, и тебе от этого не страшно.","target":"Ballerina: Mi se pare că stai ca un prostuț și așa nu ți-e frică.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-362.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14244,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452530708489","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Ballerina_Photo_DontShoot_02ac098","source":"Ballerina: А ты сам понимаешь, к чему всё идёт?","target":"Ballerina: Tu însuți înțelegi încotro se îndreaptă totul?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-362.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
