{"ordinal":14246,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452530708487","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Ballerina_Armpit_DontShoot_0f16e7d","source":"Ballerina: Так ты теперь другой танец танцуешь. Я давно его знааааю.","target":"Ballerina: Acum dansezi alt dans. Îl știu de muuuult.","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-362.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
{"ordinal":14247,"stableId":"string:444ff14f1967f5a4c8eb9e4cf4c913f1:110504452530708486","collection":"Dialogs","key":"line:Ballerina_Armpit_DontShoot_02eca6f","source":"Ballerina: Ты из-за танцев такой раздражительный теперь?","target":"Ballerina: Dansul te-a făcut atât de irascibil?","batchPath":"Translations/ro/dialogue-batch-362.json","reviewResult":"read-with-adjacent-scene-and-branch-context"}
